Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:08:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add origin-local forwarding authorization primitives

Require an exact accepted local origin binding and live authoritative creator lease before delegated creation. Add bounded paginated lease reads without replica fallback. This is the first implementation slice; transport integration follows before shipping.

Proof: bash scripts/run_tests.sh tests/hermes_cli/test_origin_forward_authority.py: 29 passed; initial 18 cases failed before module existed.
